<title>MALAYSIA: Country Heights year net up 24.8 pct.</title>
<headline>Country Heights year net up 24.8 pct.</headline>
<dateline>KUALA LUMPUR 1997-05-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year to Feb 28, 1997</p>
<p>		     (In million ringgit unless stated)</p>
<p>    Net profit		 73.08	  vs	    58.58</p>
<p>    Shr	    (cents)   48.7	   vs	    39.1</p>
<p>    Dividend     (cents)   14.0	   vs	    13.0</p>
<p>    Turnover		  276.69	  vs	   207.21</p>
<p>    Pre-tax profit	  115.01	  vs	    85.39</p>
<p>    Minorities    less	5.46	  vs  less     1.23</p>
<p>NOTE: Country Heights Holdings bhd is involved in contruction, property development and theme parks business</p>
<p>-- Kuala Lumpur newsroom (603-201 4813)</p>
